{{ ref: 6154a6f8-4230-4e9b-9c34-1691a0c29bba }}
- **Description**: The full objective J(T) with per-candidate breakdowns so users see why a tree ranks where it does, plus multi-start diversification: 10·k seeded restarts, a score-tolerance filter, and greedy max-min selection by variation of information — returning k genuinely different candidates or fewer with `solutionSpaceConverged: true` (AD-2).
--{ ref: 6154a6f8-4230-4e9b-9c34-1691a0c29bba }--

